     above it is what keeps the two halves reading as one section with two
     movements rather than two sections that lost their divider. */
  .asu__aboutCraft {
    margin-top: clamp(2.6rem, 7vh, 4.5rem);
    padding-top: clamp(2.2rem, 6vh, 3.6rem);
